  "question": "The system depicts a bank savings system\n\nMain functions of the system\n1 Customer management: including basic information of customers, such as name, address, phone number, ID number, etc.\n2 Savings bank management: including basic information of savings banks, such as name, address, phone number, etc.\n3 Deposit and withdrawal management: record customer deposit and withdrawal information, including deposit and withdrawal amount, expiration date, password, interest rate, type, etc.",
  "ddl": "-- Schema for database: rschema_0151\nCREATE TABLE `customers` (\n  `customer_id` int(11) NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n  `customer_name` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  `address` varchar(255) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `phone_number` varchar(20) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `id_number` varchar(50) NOT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`customer_id`),\n  UNIQUE KEY `id_number` (`id_number`)\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `savings_banks` (\n  `bank_id` int(11) NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n  `bank_name` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  `address` varchar(255) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `phone_number` varchar(20) DEFAULT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`bank_id`)\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `deposit_withdrawals` (\n  `transaction_id` int(11) NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n  `customer_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `bank_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `transaction_type` varchar(20) NOT NULL,\n  `amount` decimal(12,2) NOT NULL,\n  `expiration_date` date DEFAULT NULL,\n  `password` varchar(255) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `interest_rate` decimal(5,2) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `deposit_date` datetime NOT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`transaction_id`),\n  KEY `customer_id` (`customer_id`),\n  KEY `bank_id` (`bank_id`),\n  CONSTRAINT `deposit_withdrawals_ibfk_1` FOREIGN KEY (`customer_id`) REFERENCES `customers` (`customer_id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE,\n  CONSTRAINT `deposit_withdrawals_ibfk_2` FOREIGN KEY (`bank_id`) REFERENCES `savings_banks` (`bank_id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;",
